   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 8. (i) V(w) = C u(w) (x) u(w) for several w, and the closed form of u(w) as a flag. u = e1^T e^{a E12} e^{b E13} e^{c E23}\n   has line l = (1, a, b + a c) and plane pi = (pi12, pi13, pi23) = (1, c, -b) (plain matrix units); vacL has (l0, pi0) at (p1, p2, p3).\n   Read off at point 1, adjoint:  l_k = l0_k (z_k - w2)(z_k - w3),  pi_k = pi0_k / (z_k - w3)  (pi_k labelled by the complementary index,\n   pi12 <-> 3, pi13 <-> 2, pi23 <-> 1), up to overall scale. Incidence holds because the vacL relation for p3 is sum(+-) z_k l0_k pi0_k = 0.\n   (ii) the plain product D_B(k1) x S_B(w): rank / symmetry of its covector. ---- *)\nClearAll[vOfW, flag, fl0, flagPred, abcFromFlag, wListV, rowsV];\nvOfW[ww_] := Module[{tcW, tauL, qdL, QuL, blk, dets},\n    tcW[a_, k_] := Sum[(Times @@ ww[[II]]) N[qcoefT[II, k], precT], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n    tauL = Table[Sum[(tcW[a, k] . omW)[[1]] u^k, {k, 0, 2 a}], {a, 3}];\n    qdL = Table[solveMonicT[BaxDualT[tauL, 1 / N[ww[[j]], precT]], 2 repT[[j]]][[1]], {j, 3}];\n    QuL[j_, x_] := N[ww[[j]], precT]^(-x / hT) qpolyT[qdL[[j]], x];\n    blk[{alpha_, {i_, j_}}, {beta_, st_}] := Sum[With[{x = polesV[[r]]}, wPoleV[[r]] perV[alpha, x] x^beta Switch[st,\n        1, -QuL[j, x] Table[QdT[B, i, x], {B, dcT}], 2, QuL[j, x] Table[QdT[B, i, x - hT], {B, dcT}], 3, QuL[j, x + hT] Table[QdT[B, i, x], {B, dcT}]]], {r, Length[polesV]}];\n    dets = Module[{blocks = Table[blk[rk, ck], {rk, rowKeysV}, {ck, colKeysV}]}, Table[Det[blocks[[All, All, B]]], {B, dcT}]];\n    (dets / psiRefV) . Inverse[ketMatT]\n];\nflag[{a_, b_, c_}] := {{1, a, b + a c}, {1, c, -b}};\nfl0 = flag[{p1T, p2T, p3T}];\n(* predicted flag, normalized to first entries 1; pi components ordered (pi12, pi13, pi23) <-> complementary index (3, 2, 1) *)\nflagPred[ww_] := With[{lr = Table[fl0[[1, k]] (zT[[k]] - ww[[2]]) (zT[[k]] - ww[[3]]), {k, 3}], pr = Table[fl0[[2, m]] / (zT[[{3, 2, 1}[[m]]]] - ww[[3]]), {m, 3}]}, {lr / lr[[1]], pr / pr[[1]]}];\nabcFromFlag[{l_, pp_}] := {l[[2]], -pp[[3]], pp[[2]]};\nwListV = {{3/2, 5/4, 8/15}, {2, 3/7, 7/6}, {7/2, 2/5, 5/7}};\nrowsV = Table[\n    With[{v = vOfW[ww]}, With[{rt = rotTest[v], M = matOf[v]},\n        With[{uPred = UnitVector[dsT, 1] . MatrixExp[#[[1]] Normal[ElT[1, 2]]] . MatrixExp[#[[2]] Normal[ElT[1, 3]]] . MatrixExp[#[[3]] Normal[ElT[2, 3]]] &[abcFromFlag[flagPred[ww]]]},\n            {ww, N[rt, 3], N[Max[Abs[M / M[[1, 1]] - Outer[Times, uPred, uPred]]], 3],\n             With[{vp = ((detD /. k1 -> 3/11) (v . ketMatT)) . Inverse[ketMatT]}, N[rotTest[vp], 3]]}\n        ]]],\n    {ww, wListV}\n];\nGrid[\n    Prepend[rowsV, {\"w\", \"V(w): {sigma2/sigma1, asymmetry}\", \"|M/M11 - u_pred (x) u_pred|\", \"product D_B(k1 = 3/11) S_B(w): {sigma2/sigma1, asymmetry}\"}],\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
