  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### $S_B(w)$ times the second factor $\\langle k_2^{u/h}p(u)Q_{12}\\rangle$\n\nSame second factor as `L2-mathcalA.wb` / `L2-det-mathcalA.wb` (site-1 poles $\\theta_1..\\theta_1+\\lambda_2h$, $p(u)=1/\\prod_{n=\\lambda_2+1}^{\\lambda_1}(u-\\theta_2-nh)$, normalized at $\\theta_1$). Question: is $S_B(w)\\,F_B=\\langle V(w)|\\sum_m(-1)^m\\binom{\\lambda_2}{m}k_2^m\\,t^{(1)}_{\\{m,m\\}}(\\theta_1)\\otimes1|\\Psi_B\\rangle$, with $V(w)=C\\,u\\otimes u$?\n\n**Yes** — $[3,1,0]$ pt 1, $[3,2,0]$ pt 1, $[2,1,0]$ pt 3, three $w$ each; relative residual $\\le10^{-76}$, all orders in $k_2$. The fitted $c'_m$ in $\\langle V|t^{(1)}_{\\{m,m\\}}\\otimes1|\\Psi_B\\rangle=c'_mS_BY_{m,B}$ equal $\\rho_m=p(\\theta_1+mh)/p(\\theta_1)$ exactly and do not depend on $w$: the same constants as with $\\langle v_1\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|$ and $\\langle v_1\\otimes v_1|$. (At $w=z$, pt 3, $S_B$ is supported on $\\Omega$ only, so the $c'_m$ fit is 0/0; the identity itself still holds to $10^{-97}$.)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 10. Second factor on top of the 6x6. Definitions of Q12, Y, t_mm, p, F exactly as L2-det-mathcalA cell 11.\n   c'_m fitted from <V| t_mm (x) 1 |Psi_B> = c'_m S_B Y_{m,B} over all states; then the full product vs the binomial sum, all orders in k2. ---- *)\nClearAll[Q12T, YA2, T1siteT, qmin1siteT, tG1siteT, tmmT, nuSiteT, pT, measA2, FA2, secondW];\nQ12T[A_, x_] := QdT[A, 1, x] QdT[A, 2, x - hT] - QdT[A, 2, x] QdT[A, 1, x - hT];\nYA2 = Table[Q12T[A, thT[[1]] + m hT] / Q12T[A, thT[[1]]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}, {A, dcT}];\nT1siteT[i_, j_][x_] := (x - thT[[1]]) KroneckerDelta[i, j] IdentityMatrix[dsT] - hT Normal[ElT[j, i]];\nqmin1siteT[II_][x_] := Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[T1siteT[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]]][x - (k - 1) hT], {k, Length[II]}], {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\ntG1siteT[a_][x_] := Sum[(Times @@ zT[[II]]) qmin1siteT[II][x], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ntmmT[0] = IdentityMatrix[dsT];\ntmmT[1] = With[{x = thT[[1]]}, tG1siteT[2][x] / (nu1site1A2[x] nu1site1A2[x - hT])];\ntmmT[2] = With[{x = thT[[1]]}, (tG1siteT[2][x] . tG1siteT[2][x + hT] - tG1siteT[3][x + hT] . tG1siteT[1][x]) / (nu1site1A2[x] nu1site1A2[x - hT] nu1site1A2[x + hT] nu1site1A2[x])];\nnuSiteT[s_, n_][x_] := x - thT[[s]] - hT repT[[n]];\npT[x_] := 1 / Product[x - thT[[2]] - n hT, {n, repT[[2]] + 1, repT[[1]]}];\nmeasA2[x_] := pT[x] / Product[nuSiteT[1, 3][x - k hT], {k, 0, repT[[2]]}];\nFA2 = Module[{x, res = Table[Residue[measA2[x], {x, thT[[1]] + m hT}], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}]},\n    Table[Sum[k2^m res[[m + 1]] / res[[1]] YA2[[m + 1, A]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}], {A, dcT}]\n];\n(* per w: {w, c'_m, spread of c'_m, rho_m, final residual} *)\nsecondW[ww_] := Module[{v = vOfW[ww], sB, lhs, rr, cm},\n    sB = v . ketMatT;\n    lhs = Table[v . N[KroneckerProduct[tmmT[m], IdentityMatrix[dsT]], precT] . ketMatT, {m, 0, repT[[2]]}];\n    rr = Table[lhs[[m + 1]] / (sB YA2[[m + 1]]), {m, 0, repT[[2]]}];\n    cm = Rationalize[Mean /@ rr, 10^-50];\n    {ww, cm, N[Max[Abs[# - Mean[#]]] & /@ rr, 3], Table[pT[thT[[1]] + m hT] / pT[thT[[1]]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}],\n     N[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[Expand[sB FA2 - Sum[(-1)^m Binomial[repT[[2]], m] k2^m lhs[[m + 1]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}]], k2]]]] / Max[Abs[sB]], 3]}\n];\nrowsSecW = secondW /@ wListV;\nGrid[\n    Prepend[rowsSecW, {\"w\", \"c'_m (fitted)\", \"spread of c'_m over states\", \"rho_m = p(θ1 + m h)/p(θ1)\", \"relative residual of S_B F_B vs <V| sum_m ... t_mm (x) 1 |Psi_B>\"}],\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
